1
00:00:11,200 --> 00:00:18,260
♪If I am gone from this world,
will the dark night collapse?♪

2
00:00:18,880 --> 00:00:25,820
♪If I never return
to guard by your side♪

3
00:00:26,270 --> 00:00:30,800
♪If I seal away our encounter
and erase all trace♪

4
00:00:31,010 --> 00:00:33,900
♪Like endless snow
falling into the deep sea♪

5
00:00:33,972 --> 00:00:40,272
♪This life is but a fleeting illusion,
yet it gave me courage♪

6
00:00:40,510 --> 00:00:41,740
♪Love is a miracle♪

7
00:00:41,740 --> 00:00:42,920
=Spring Over Phoenix Pond=

8
00:00:42,920 --> 00:00:45,300
(Adapted from Qin An'an's
"Spring Over Phoenix Pond")

9
00:00:45,340 --> 00:00:48,260
=Episode 13=

10
00:01:07,870 --> 00:01:09,122
I'm here for you, Your Highness!

11
00:01:19,150 --> 00:01:20,590
Are you trying to get yourself killed?

12
00:01:20,700 --> 00:01:22,280
You were hurt.
Why take an arrow for me?

13
00:01:24,150 --> 00:01:25,710
No one wants to die.

14
00:01:26,310 --> 00:01:27,070
It's just...

15
00:01:27,920 --> 00:01:28,680
Just what?

16
00:01:31,510 --> 00:01:33,120
You mean more to me

17
00:01:34,920 --> 00:01:36,040
than my own life.

18
00:01:39,760 --> 00:01:40,560
Don't say that.

19
00:01:44,640 --> 00:01:45,640
Wake up, Xiao Yunting.

20
00:01:46,310 --> 00:01:47,070
Xiao Yunting,

21
00:01:47,790 --> 00:01:48,640
listen.

22
00:01:49,230 --> 00:01:50,310
You still owe me

23
00:01:50,680 --> 00:01:51,840
from our last life.

24
00:01:53,150 --> 00:01:54,190
You're not allowed to die.

25
00:01:54,310 --> 00:01:55,040
Wake up.

26
00:01:55,350 --> 00:01:56,790
Wake up, Xiao Yunting.

27
00:01:57,140 --> 00:01:57,540
(Yueying Pleasure House)

28
00:02:02,760 --> 00:02:04,000
Merciful Buddha,

29
00:02:04,710 --> 00:02:06,790
I've never asked anything of you.

30
00:02:07,280 --> 00:02:10,590
I pray only for one person.

31
00:02:12,240 --> 00:02:15,310
He was innocent
in the Yueying Pleasure House incident.

32
00:02:16,150 --> 00:02:17,910
But he was wounded because of me.

33
00:02:18,470 --> 00:02:21,430
Please let me bear

34
00:02:22,800 --> 00:02:24,560
all the karma alone

35
00:02:25,590 --> 00:02:27,470
and see him safely through this.

36
00:02:33,980 --> 00:02:36,380
(Talisman)

37
00:02:38,750 --> 00:02:39,400
Young Lady,

38
00:02:39,410 --> 00:02:40,710
the imperial physician
has taken Prince Jing

39
00:02:40,710 --> 00:02:42,000
to the hot spring to recover.

40
00:02:42,120 --> 00:02:43,190
If he wakes up tonight,

41
00:02:43,200 --> 00:02:44,100
he'll be out of danger.

42
00:02:51,160 --> 00:02:55,310
♪Memories return to where it all began♪

43
00:02:56,150 --> 00:02:59,610
♪Waiting for the wounds
deep within my heart to heal♪

44
00:03:00,970 --> 00:03:05,400
♪Clinging to that lonely flame
across the shore♪

45
00:03:06,020 --> 00:03:09,360
♪You once appeared
in the depths of my obsession♪

46
00:03:12,870 --> 00:03:14,190
Qi Yuan...

47
00:03:15,520 --> 00:03:16,310
I'm here.

48
00:03:16,310 --> 00:03:19,920
♪Even if my wounds are torn apart,
I'd still live for you♪

49
00:03:21,140 --> 00:03:24,550
♪Even if time shatters,
I remember it all♪

50
00:03:24,560 --> 00:03:26,190
I dreamed of you again.

51
00:03:26,190 --> 00:03:30,280
♪It was me♪

52
00:03:30,755 --> 00:03:36,155
♪One attachment I can't let go of♪

53
00:03:36,180 --> 00:03:40,160
♪I have loved for your sake♪

54
00:03:41,070 --> 00:03:45,590
♪How I wish to hold onto
this fleeting warmth♪

55
00:03:46,180 --> 00:03:50,270
♪How I wish to live this life
only for you♪

56
00:03:50,450 --> 00:03:55,920
♪When memories sink
and the heart settles♪

57
00:03:56,090 --> 00:04:00,120
♪Forgetting life, death,
parting, and reunion♪

58
00:04:01,130 --> 00:04:05,710
♪How I wish to stay
only in the moment with you♪

59
00:04:06,130 --> 00:04:08,290
♪Anchoring myself by your side♪

60
00:04:08,310 --> 00:04:10,360
Xiao Yunting is only using you

61
00:04:10,840 --> 00:04:13,000
to regain what he lost.

62
00:04:16,810 --> 00:04:21,890
♪One attachment I can't let go of♪

63
00:04:22,440 --> 00:04:26,350
♪How I wish to live this life
only for you♪

64
00:04:26,680 --> 00:04:32,160
♪When memories sink
and the heart settles♪

65
00:04:32,390 --> 00:04:36,260
♪Forgetting life, death,
parting, and reunion♪

66
00:04:37,390 --> 00:04:41,710
♪How I wish to stay
only in the moment with you♪

67
00:04:42,120 --> 00:04:42,800
The talisman...

68
00:04:45,070 --> 00:04:45,750
Burn it.

69
00:04:46,270 --> 00:04:47,070
Once he wakes up,

70
00:04:47,270 --> 00:04:48,630
send him back to his own residence.

71
00:04:49,430 --> 00:04:50,600
You don't understand, Miss.

72
00:04:51,560 --> 00:04:53,430
When fate comes,

73
00:04:53,950 --> 00:04:56,270
there's no escaping it.

74
00:04:58,120 --> 00:04:59,680
You can barely protect yourself,

75
00:05:00,160 --> 00:05:02,600
and you're still worrying about
other people's love lives?

76
00:05:04,160 --> 00:05:06,720
Didn't you and Prince Jing
go to such lengths

77
00:05:07,070 --> 00:05:09,120
to keep me safe?

78
00:05:09,720 --> 00:05:11,000
Are you saying

79
00:05:12,630 --> 00:05:14,360
you'll testify against Prince Qi?

80
00:05:15,870 --> 00:05:18,360
He went on a killing spree
at Yueying Pleasure House that day.

81
00:05:19,430 --> 00:05:21,070
He clearly meant
to leave me no way out.

82
00:05:21,600 --> 00:05:22,680
What do you want me to do?

83
00:05:27,750 --> 00:05:30,270
Miss Qi sure changes her mind fast.

84
00:05:30,660 --> 00:05:32,310
She watched over you all night yesterday,

85
00:05:32,790 --> 00:05:34,000
and now she's sending us away.

86
00:05:36,160 --> 00:05:37,510
She stayed with me all night?

87
00:05:37,720 --> 00:05:38,270
Yes.

88
00:05:38,800 --> 00:05:39,920
She looked beside herself.

89
00:05:40,240 --> 00:05:41,240
I told you.

90
00:05:41,630 --> 00:05:43,750
Women are fickle.

91
00:05:44,870 --> 00:05:46,600
(She obviously cares about me.)

92
00:05:47,560 --> 00:05:49,390
(So why is she sending me away?)

93
00:05:51,160 --> 00:05:51,950
(Could it be...)

94
00:05:55,830 --> 00:05:56,830
(I really)

95
00:05:57,510 --> 00:05:58,830
(kissed her?)

96
00:06:01,160 --> 00:06:01,720
Your Highness.

97
00:06:03,000 --> 00:06:03,560
Your Highness.

98
00:06:04,680 --> 00:06:05,800
What are you smiling about?

99
00:06:06,950 --> 00:06:07,560
Where is she?

100
00:06:08,070 --> 00:06:09,390
Now that I'm awake,

101
00:06:09,600 --> 00:06:11,000
this can't be delayed any longer.

102
00:06:11,270 --> 00:06:12,950
Miss Qi and Miss Hong Xiao

103
00:06:13,270 --> 00:06:14,240
left early this morning?

104
00:06:14,920 --> 00:06:15,750
They left?

105
00:06:20,750 --> 00:06:22,000
I, Hong Xiao,

106
00:06:22,170 --> 00:06:24,070
accuse Prince Qi
of running a private brothel,

107
00:06:24,270 --> 00:06:25,360
trafficking people,

108
00:06:25,370 --> 00:06:26,990
and forcing decent women
into prostitution.

109
00:06:34,390 --> 00:06:35,610
(Accuse Prince Qi, Xiao Ling)
Oh, heavens.

110
00:06:35,630 --> 00:06:36,870
The Yueying Pleasure House
that burned down yesterday

111
00:06:36,870 --> 00:06:38,200
was actually owned by Prince Qi.

112
00:06:38,310 --> 00:06:39,390
It says so right here.

113
00:06:39,390 --> 00:06:40,390
Is it for real?

114
00:06:40,390 --> 00:06:41,610
There's also a ledger as proof.

115
00:06:41,620 --> 00:06:43,520
Can a prince break the law
and get away with it?

116
00:06:43,680 --> 00:06:45,270
We have to get to the bottom of this.

117
00:06:46,040 --> 00:06:47,070
This is outrageous.

118
00:06:56,600 --> 00:06:57,870
(His Majesty is biased.)

119
00:06:58,310 --> 00:06:59,510
(Only by making this public)

120
00:07:00,000 --> 00:07:01,560
(can we stop him from covering it up.)

121
00:07:05,120 --> 00:07:06,750
Two noble princes

122
00:07:07,190 --> 00:07:08,360
secretly running a brothel.

123
00:07:08,920 --> 00:07:10,680
The broadsides are all over the city.

124
00:07:11,680 --> 00:07:12,360
Now,

125
00:07:13,000 --> 00:07:14,270
the whole city

126
00:07:14,390 --> 00:07:16,120
is laughing at me.

127
00:07:20,240 --> 00:07:21,600
Your Majesty, please judge fairly.

128
00:07:21,800 --> 00:07:23,680
Prince Qi is still recovering
from his injuries.

129
00:07:23,680 --> 00:07:25,560
How could he possibly be
running a brothel?

130
00:07:25,680 --> 00:07:28,160
There's no evidence
against Prince Cheng either.

131
00:07:29,830 --> 00:07:33,950
This is clearly a deliberate setup.

132
00:07:34,560 --> 00:07:37,270
Please investigate carefully,
Your Majesty.

133
00:07:40,870 --> 00:07:42,720
Find that courtesan for me.

134
00:07:43,120 --> 00:07:44,430
I want to question her myself.

135
00:07:46,430 --> 00:07:48,680
You actually let Hong Xiao
live until now?

136
00:07:48,950 --> 00:07:50,310
What exactly did I tell you?

137
00:07:50,870 --> 00:07:51,720
I failed my duty.

138
00:07:52,160 --> 00:07:53,190
It was chaotic that night,

139
00:07:53,630 --> 00:07:54,830
and she managed to escape.

140
00:07:55,600 --> 00:07:56,750
I'm willing to redeem myself.

141
00:07:56,920 --> 00:07:58,120
I'll kill her at once.

142
00:07:58,870 --> 00:08:00,360
You want to go now?

143
00:08:03,120 --> 00:08:03,800
Then

144
00:08:04,750 --> 00:08:08,070
why shouldn't I go straight to Father
and plead guilty myself?

145
00:08:08,560 --> 00:08:09,040
Exactly.

146
00:08:11,800 --> 00:08:13,320
If Your Highness confesses voluntarily,

147
00:08:13,800 --> 00:08:15,120
His Majesty may show leniency.

148
00:08:20,950 --> 00:08:22,120
Zhuque.

149
00:08:27,750 --> 00:08:29,750
Someone is better suited

150
00:08:30,600 --> 00:08:33,240
to kill Hong Xiao than you.

151
00:08:50,000 --> 00:08:50,600
Watch out!

152
00:09:08,030 --> 00:09:08,600
(This is bad.)

153
00:09:14,320 --> 00:09:16,360
This is outrageous.

154
00:09:16,360 --> 00:09:18,630
You dared to kill a witness I summoned.

155
00:09:19,390 --> 00:09:20,200
Your Majesty,

156
00:09:20,480 --> 00:09:21,910
I am innocent.

157
00:09:22,360 --> 00:09:25,000
Hong Xiao beat the drum
to accuse Prince Qi.

158
00:09:25,390 --> 00:09:26,750
Why would I kill her?

159
00:09:27,390 --> 00:09:28,030
Your Majesty,

160
00:09:29,200 --> 00:09:32,200
Qi Yuan was caught at the scene
of the courtesan's death.

161
00:09:32,670 --> 00:09:33,320
This bow

162
00:09:34,120 --> 00:09:36,200
was taken from her hands.

163
00:09:36,720 --> 00:09:39,030
It bears the seal
of the Marquis Yongping Residence.

164
00:09:39,200 --> 00:09:39,870
Also,

165
00:09:40,150 --> 00:09:41,440
I have confirmed

166
00:09:41,550 --> 00:09:43,480
that the broadsides
were printed by Qi Yuan.

167
00:09:43,880 --> 00:09:45,910
She had originally contacted Hong Xiao
to frame me.

168
00:09:46,370 --> 00:09:47,960
But she feared
Hong Xiao would turn on her,

169
00:09:48,200 --> 00:09:50,320
so she killed her.

170
00:09:51,270 --> 00:09:53,030
You're twisting the truth.

171
00:09:55,630 --> 00:09:56,200
Your Majesty,

172
00:09:56,480 --> 00:09:58,030
someone else killed Hong Xiao.

173
00:09:58,360 --> 00:09:59,510
I saw it with my own eyes.

174
00:09:59,660 --> 00:10:01,840
I, Xiao Yunting, am willing
to stake my own name on it.

175
00:10:01,870 --> 00:10:03,750
Please restore her innocence.

176
00:10:04,120 --> 00:10:05,440
Xiao Yunting.

177
00:10:06,790 --> 00:10:08,440
The evidence is conclusive.

178
00:10:09,000 --> 00:10:11,320
And you still vouch for this woman?

179
00:10:11,440 --> 00:10:12,630
You've gone mad.

180
00:10:13,270 --> 00:10:13,790
Guards,

181
00:10:14,270 --> 00:10:15,200
take him away.

182
00:10:15,320 --> 00:10:16,390
Fifty lashes.

183
00:10:16,790 --> 00:10:17,360
Your Majesty,

184
00:10:17,720 --> 00:10:19,320
Prince Jing has nothing to do with this.

185
00:10:19,510 --> 00:10:20,550
Let alone protecting me.

186
00:10:21,080 --> 00:10:21,790
Your Majesty,

187
00:10:22,320 --> 00:10:23,150
ministers,

188
00:10:23,550 --> 00:10:26,090
Hong Xiao was the daughter
of a wealthy merchant from the south.

189
00:10:26,440 --> 00:10:27,720
She entered the brothel willingly

190
00:10:27,840 --> 00:10:29,440
only to repay her father's debts.

191
00:10:29,690 --> 00:10:31,080
Though she became one of the lowly,

192
00:10:31,200 --> 00:10:32,390
her heart remained kind.

193
00:10:32,480 --> 00:10:34,360
She sheltered those homeless women

194
00:10:34,360 --> 00:10:35,840
so they would not die in the streets.

195
00:10:36,030 --> 00:10:37,720
She was such a gentle woman.

196
00:10:37,750 --> 00:10:39,150
Yet she was thrown away like trash

197
00:10:39,200 --> 00:10:40,320
and cruelly killed.

198
00:10:40,870 --> 00:10:42,270
If this case is not resolved,

199
00:10:42,550 --> 00:10:43,910
how can any woman in this world

200
00:10:44,360 --> 00:10:46,000
still dare to speak of justice?

201
00:10:47,440 --> 00:10:49,670
Why would Miss Qi do this?

202
00:10:49,670 --> 00:10:50,670
What a vicious heart.

203
00:10:50,670 --> 00:10:51,840
She's heartless.

204
00:10:51,840 --> 00:10:52,390
Your Majesty,

205
00:10:52,440 --> 00:10:54,240
this cannot be pardoned.

206
00:10:54,320 --> 00:10:55,510
I second the motion.

207
00:10:55,600 --> 00:10:57,720
- We second it.
- We second it.

208
00:10:57,720 --> 00:10:58,390
Your Majesty,

209
00:10:58,710 --> 00:11:00,320
before this matter is fully investigated,

210
00:11:00,750 --> 00:11:03,080
I'm willing to enter the dungeon.

211
00:11:16,260 --> 00:11:20,900
♪How I wish to hold onto
this fleeting warmth♪

212
00:11:21,280 --> 00:11:25,060
♪How I wish to live this life
only for you♪

213
00:11:25,570 --> 00:11:31,030
♪When memories sink
and the heart settles♪

214
00:11:31,250 --> 00:11:35,410
♪Forgetting life, death,
parting, and reunion♪

215
00:11:36,200 --> 00:11:40,480
♪How I wish to stay
only in the moment with you♪

216
00:11:41,280 --> 00:11:48,180
♪Anchoring myself by your side♪
